  "code": "nhip = [\"kick\", \"snare\", \"kick\", \"hat\", \"kick\", \"kick\", \"snare\", \"hat\"]\n\nfor i, am in enumerate(nhip):\n    if am == \"kick\":\n        phat(\"Bùm\")\n    elif am == \"snare\":\n        phat(\"Chát\")\n    else:\n        phat(\"Xì\")\n    if i == 5:\n        break",
